flowchart LR
  Q1{"Sensitive data may be<br/>stored in Snowflake,<br/>even encrypted?"}
  Q2{"Users need the<br/>Snowflake UX?"}
  Q3{"Only arithmetic<br/>needed?"}
  Q4{"Read plaintext inside<br/>the Snowflake UX?"}
  O1["Option 1<br/>On-demand tunnel"]
  O3["Option 3<br/>Local join"]
  HE["Bonus<br/>Homomorphic"]
